Plato. Sophist, translated by Benjamin Jowett. Project Gutenberg ebook 1735. English.

[Retained EPUB](../books/plato-sophist.epub) · [Original book and notices](https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1735). Project Gutenberg identifies this edition as public domain in the USA; the retained file preserves its original notices and production credits.

Read the complete dialogue with [the advanced seminar on being, difference, and falsehood](../research/seminars/Plato-being-and-knowledge.lingua#r_34WRXN1SRY8SZVRKRV7X3X9QWA). The opening classifications, the ontological investigation, and the account of false statement belong to the whole argument.

Use this translation alongside [an identified critical Greek text](Plato-critical-editions.lingua#r_28N1ADM4R3DAG5K2898WPKRXCK) and [a substantial commentary](Sophist-Cordero.lingua#r_5MPQY66DGXV4RRE8GCWCCKJ952). The English rendering and translator's introduction supply particular interpretations to compare and examine.

